        "id": "U8-D6",
        "statement": "Shortfall rule taken from the accepted design note: an order is paid in full or not at all. This is exactly Ledger.transfer\u0027s behaviour (it refuses amounts above available with InsufficientFunds and records nothing), so the run just calls transfer and reports Skipped(id, error); no partial payment logic exists. Because transfer checks available, held money cannot pay an order (U7-D5).",
