      {
        "id": "U8-D7",
        "statement": "The reference is built with date.ToString(\u0022yyyy-MM-dd\u0022, CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) and exposed as StandingOrders.reference (public, so the rule lives once and callers/tests can find a payment). No separate paid-orders record was added to LedgerState: the journal reference is the idempotence record, as R3 states. \u0027Already in the journal\u0027 means any posting in LedgerState.Postings whose Reference equals it ordinally, on any account; so a posting made by other means with that exact reference also counts as already paid.",
